The citation styles in this repository (*.csl) are licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported License (CC BY-SA 3.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

They are adapted from the NLM/Vancouver style in the Citation Style Language
repository (https://github.com/citation-style-language/styles), which is
licensed the same way; its authors are credited in each file, which also links
to it as its template. tests/locales-en-US.xml is the CSL project's US English
locale, under the same license.

No license is given yet for the rest of this repository (checks, scripts and
the lab's safeguard files).
